{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "dc918cbf-aa32-8df4-b079-4d7118ab25bb",
  "created_at": "2026-01-07T16:07:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Judith E. Brownell",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T16:06:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing, this is Walter. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T16:06:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. I had a question about voting. Early voting, specifically. When does it, um, when can people do it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T16:06:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Is this for an upcoming election you're thinking of, or are you just looking ahead?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T16:06:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, just looking ahead. Well, actually, I'm not sure if there's one coming up. [pause] Sorry, I lost my train of thought. Ha. Is there something this winter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T16:06:28-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nothing citywide right now that I'm aware of. Early voting, or mail ballot voting in person, opens ahead of each election, and the dates are set for each one. Once an election is scheduled, the dates are posted on the state elections website and here at the office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T16:06:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. So it depends on which election. That makes sense. Oh, hang on, that's my phone beeping. It's the cordless, the battery's low. I'll talk fast."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T16:06:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Do you want me to go over anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T16:06:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. What ID do I need to bring? Is it a driver's license only, or can it be other things?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T16:07:03-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rhode Island asks for a valid photo ID at the polls. A driver's license works, and so do a few other kinds, like a passport or a student ID. If you don't have one, there are procedures, and we can walk you through them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T16:07:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a license is fine. Good. And a passport, I have that, too. [pause] It's beeping again, sorry. What was I going to say? Oh, no, I think that's everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T16:07:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then you're all set. If you want, I can take your number and call you when dates are posted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T16:07:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's okay, I'll check the website. Thank you so much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T16:07:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good evening."
    }
  ],
